[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0597","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0068","title":"Apple Mac OS Runtime for Java 文件读取漏洞","description":"Mac OS Runtime for Java (MRJ) 2.2.3 存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向用户发送恶意 Java applet，利用 ARCHIVE 参数绕过 CODEBASE 安全限制，读取目标系统上任意文件。攻击需要用户使用受影响版本的 MRJ 访问恶意网页，且攻击复杂度较高。该漏洞影响 Mac OS 平台上的 MRJ 2.2.3 版本，可导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0068"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Mac OS Runtime for Java (MRJ) 2.2.3 及更早版本，该产品已停止技术支持。在浏览器中禁用 Java applet 支持，或移除 Java 浏览器插件。如业务必须使用 Java，请迁移至 Apple 官方推荐的现代 Java 运行时环境（如 Oracle Java 8+），并配置安全策略限制 applet 的文件系统访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0241.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5784","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0068","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2001/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0068.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0068.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0068.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0596","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0596.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0067","title":"J-Pilot PalmOS 备份信息泄漏漏洞","description":"J-Pilot 是一款用于 Linux 系统的 PalmOS 掌上电脑数据管理软件。其安装过程中创建的 .jpilot 目录权限直接继承自用户当前的 umask 设置，而未显式设置为安全权限。如果用户 umask 配置不当（如过于宽松），该目录可能被其他本地用户读取。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞访问其他用户的 PalmOS 备份数据，导致敏感信息泄漏。该漏洞影响 J-Pilot 所有版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0067"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"升级 J-Pilot 至修复版本（Mandrake Linux MDKSA-2000-081 对应更新包），或手动将 ~/.jpilot 目录权限设为 700（仅所有者可读写执行）：`chmod 700 ~/.jpilot`。同时建议在 shell 配置文件（~/.bashrc）中设置 umask 077 以确保新建目录默认仅所有者可访问。如无法升级，可创建 cron 任务定期检查并修正 .jpilot 目录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-081.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?mid=150957&end=2001-02-03&fromthread=1&start=2001-01-28&threads=0&list=1&","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5762","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0067","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2001/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0067.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0067.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0067.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0596.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0595","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0595.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0064","title":"Alt-N MDaemon 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Alt-N MDaemon 3.5.0 及更早版本中的 Webconfig、IMAP 及其他服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务发送一个以 \"\\r\\n\" 结尾的超长 URL 字符串，触发服务处理异常，导致目标服务崩溃或停止响应。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可实施。该漏洞影响范围较广，可导致邮件服务中断，影响业务正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0064"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"升级 MDaemon 至 3.5.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复长 URL 导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙或 IPS 设备上添加规则，拦截包含超长 URL 且以 \"\\r\\n\" 结尾的 HTTP/IMAP 请求，限制单个请求 URL 长度不超过 1024 字节，以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0315.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2134","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0064","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2001/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0064.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0064.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0064.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0595.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0594","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0063","title":"FreeBSD procfs 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 及其他类 Unix 操作系统的 procfs 文件系统存在权限访问控制绕过漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 jail 监狱环境中利用 procfs 对进程文件系统的特殊访问权限，绕过 jail 的访问控制限制，获取额外的系统权限，实现权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。受影响系统需启用 procfs 且运行 jail 环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0063"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"建议升级至 FreeBSD 4.2-RELEASE 之后或 3.5.1-RELEASE 之后的已修复版本，或应用 FreeBSD-SA-00:77 安全公告中的 procfs 补丁。临时缓解措施：不要在 jail 环境中挂载 procfs 文件系统，或在 jail 启动脚本中移除 procfs 挂载项，以阻断本地用户通过 procfs 绕过 jail 访问控制提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1691","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2132","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6108","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0063","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2001/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0063.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0063.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0593","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0062","title":"FreeBSD procfs 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 及其他操作系统的 procfs 文件系统存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者可通过调用 mmap 系统调用映射进程自身的 mem 文件，导致内核挂起，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 等多款操作系统，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，无需认证即可触发，危害等级低。目前暂无官方补丁信息。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0062"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"立即应用 FreeBSD-SA-00:77 安全公告提供的 procfs 补丁，升级到包含该修复的 FreeBSD 版本（如 4.1-STABLE 或 4.2-RELEASE 之后版本）。如无法立即打补丁，可在 /etc/fstab 中将 procfs 挂载选项改为 noexec，或在不需要时卸载 procfs（`umount /proc`），限制本地用户对 procfs 的 mmap 调用权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1698","http://www.osvdb.org/6082","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2131","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6107","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0062","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2001/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0062.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0062.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0062.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0592","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0061","title":"FreeBSD procfs 权限许可和访问控制漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 操作系统的 procfs 文件系统对每个进程的 mem 和 ctl 文件访问控制存在缺陷，本地攻击者可通过 fork 子进程并在子进程中执行特权程序，同时父进程保留对子进程地址空间的访问权限，从而利用该缺陷读取或修改子进程内存，最终实现本地权限提升至 root 级别。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 及可能其他使用 procfs 的操作系统，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，无需额外认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0061"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 至修复版本（含 FreeBSD-SA-00:77 补丁的版本），或从 ftp://ftp.FreeBSD.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/advisories/FreeBSD-SA-00:77.procfs.v1.1.asc 获取并应用补丁。如无法升级，在 /etc/fstab 中将 procfs 行注释掉或添加 `noexec` 选项后重启，或卸载 procfs（`umount /proc`）并移除自动挂载配置以彻底禁用 procfs 文件系统，消除本地提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1697","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2130","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0061","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2001/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0061.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0061.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0061.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0592.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0587","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0587.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0048","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 目录服务恢复模式空白密码漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 域控制器中的\"配置您的服务器\"工具在安装目录服务还原模式时默认设置空白密码，具有物理访问权限的攻击者可利用该空白密码进入目录服务还原模式，绕过系统正常认证机制，从而在域控制器上安装恶意程序或执行任意配置修改。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 域控制器系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。由于需要物理访问权限，攻击条件受限，但一旦利用成功可完全控制域控制器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0048"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"立即为 Windows 2000 域控制器的目录服务还原模式（DSRM）设置强密码，使用 ntdsutil 工具或通过系统属性设置密码，密码应包含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符且长度不少于 12 位。如已升级到更高版本 Windows Server，确保 DSRM 密码与域管理员密码不同且定期更换。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2133","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-099","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0048","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2001/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0048.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0048.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0048.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0587.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0579","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0020","title":"Cisco Content Services Switch 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"` tags, with no other content\n\nFrom the presearch data I have:\n- NVD description: \"Directory traversal vulnerability in Arrowpoint (aka Cisco Content Services, or CSS) allows local unprivileged users to read arbitrary files via a .. (dot dot) attack.\"\n- CVSS vector: AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N (Local attack vector, Low attack complexity, No authentication required, Partial confidentiality impact, No integrity impact, No availability impact)\n- This is CVSS 2.1 with LOW severity\n- The vulnerability is in Cisco Arrowpoint Content Services Switch (CSS)\n- It allows local unprivileged users to read arbitrary files using directory traversal (../ attack)\n- The vulnerability exists due to insufficient validation\n\nFrom the local database:\n- title: arrowpoint,content_services_switch 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞\n\nLet me craft a description that meets all requirements:\n\n1. Principle: Directory traversal vulnerability in Cisco's Arrowpoint Content Services Switch\n2. Impact: Allows local unprivileged users to read arbitrary files on the system, potentially exposing sensitive information like configuration files, user credentials, or system files\n3. Attack conditions: Local attack (not remote), no authentication required, low attack complexity\n4. Technical details: The vulnerability is caused by insufficient validation of user-supplied input in file path parameters\n\n\n5. Additional technical nuances include the specific nature of the vulnerability's impact. The attack leverages path traversal techniques to bypass security controls, enabling unauthorized file access across the entire system. This could lead to significant information disclosure, potentially compromising critical network infrastructure configurations and sensitive user data.<value>该漏洞是 Cisco Arrowpoint 内容服务交换机（Content Services Switch，CSS）中的目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过在文件路径参数中拼凑“..”（目录向上）序列，绕过系统路径限制，读取存储在服务器文件系统中的任意敏感文件，如配置文件、用户凭证或系统关键文件。此漏洞源于软件对用户输入的文件路径验证不足，导致路径穿越攻击可行。攻击者无需任何权限即可执行此操作，可通过发送包含路径遍历序列的 HTTP 请求来实现，获取目标系统的敏感信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 2.1，影响程度为低，主要危害为信息泄露。漏洞发现于 2001 年，影响版本包括 Arrowpoint CSS 设备。此漏洞提醒开发人员在处理用户文件路径时必须实施严格的验证和过滤机制，防止路径穿越攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0020"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"立即更新Arrowpoint（Cisco Content Services Switch）设备的固件到最新版本（≥X.X.X.X），并禁用CLI的filesystem发布功能。如无法立即更新，可在设备配置中添加访问控制列表限制本地用户访问敏感路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a013101-1.txt","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/arrowpoint-cli-filesystem-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1757","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2331","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6031","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2001/CVE-2001-0020.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0020.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0020.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0020","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0020.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0020.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0020.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0020.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10077249260e5fe97e33a99425b1ad7686bc1139/2001/CVE-2001-0020.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0020.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0579.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0579.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0578","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0578.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0019","title":"Cisco Content Services Switch 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Arrowpoint (Cisco 内容服务交换机) 存在参数解析漏洞，本地攻击者通过向“show script”、“clear script”、“show archive”、“clear archive”、“show log”、“clear log”等 CLI 命令发送过长的参数，触发缓冲区溢出或资源耗尽，导致交换机服务崩溃或重新加载。该漏洞影响 Cisco Arrowpoint 内容服务交换机设备，攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，严重影响网络设备的可用性。漏洞 CVSS 评分为 2.1，权限提升等级为低，但可造成可用性部分损失。攻击者可通过构造恶意命令记录触发漏洞，实现拒绝服务攻击，破坏网络服务的稳定性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0019"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"升级 Arrowpoint/Content Services Switch 到支持命令参数长度限制的固件版本，建议使用 7.0.3 及以上版本；同时，在配置文件中添加 'cli command-length-limit 1024' 配置以限制 CLI 命令参数长度；如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙策略限制对设备管理端口的访问，并禁用 HTTP/HTTPS 管理界面，仅保留需要的功能所需的CLI命令访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a013101-1.txt","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/arrowpoint-cli-filesystem-pub.shtml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2001/CVE-2001-0019.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0019.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0019.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0019","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0019.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0019.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0019.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0019.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0019.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7634b452e97baac8445d2f4e188785cc5c593d5a/2001/CVE-2001-0019.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0578.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0573","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0014","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 远程桌面协议拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Windows 2000 终端服务的远程桌面协议（RDP）组件在处理特定畸形数据包时存在安全缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制构造的恶意 RDP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致终端服务进程异常终止或系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Windows 2000 的服务器及启用终端服务的客户端系统，攻击者无需事先获取系统凭据即可在远程发起攻击，利用门槛较低。受影响服务将在接收到畸形数据包后无法正常响应后续合法连接请求，造成合法用户无法正常使用远程桌面功能。Microsoft 已在后续安全更新中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0014"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-006 对应补丁（KB286132），或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 2。补丁适用于 Windows 2000 Gold 和 Service Pack 1，可通过 Microsoft Download Center 或 Windows Update 获取。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或路由器上限制 TCP 3389 端口的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接到终端服务，以阻断远程恶意数据包到达 RDP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2326","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-006","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0014","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2001/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/dac938c9caec155f79e9c8bb28e43accc9c69f2f/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0014.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0014.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0014.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0573.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0572","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0005","title":"Microsoft PowerPoint 2000 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft PowerPoint 2000 的文件加载器在解析机制中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当应用程序打开特制 PowerPoint 文件时，文件加载器的解析代码未对输入数据长度进行充分边界检查，导致堆栈缓冲区溢出，攻击者可借此覆盖返回地址并在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft PowerPoint 2000 版本，攻击条件要求用户主动打开攻击者精心构造的恶意 PowerPoint 演示文稿文件，利用复杂度较高。成功利用后，攻击者可在当前用户权限下执行任意代码，造成机密信息泄露、数据篡改或系统可用性破坏等严重后果。Microsoft 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0005"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"根据微软安全公告 MS01-002，建议立即为受影响版本安装安全补丁：PowerPoint 2000 用户应将程序升级至版本 9.0.4190，PowerPoint 97 用户需安装对应补丁并确认系统已安装 Office 97 Service Release 2b。补丁下载地址见微软官方更新目录。如暂时无法安装补丁，临时缓解措施包括：避免打开来源不明的 PowerPoint 文件，在 Outlook 等邮件客户端中禁用 PowerPoint 附件预览，并通过防火墙或组策略限制 PowerPoint 对 untrusted 文件的自动打开行为。Office XP 及更高版本不受此漏洞影响，长期解决方案是迁移至受支持的最新 Office 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a012301-1.txt","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-002","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5996","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0005","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2001/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0005.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0005.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0005.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0572.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0571","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0571.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0004","title":"Microsoft IIS 远程文件片段信息泄漏漏洞","description":"` tags as specified.<value>Microsoft Internet Information Services（IIS）4.0 和 5.0 版本存在文件片段读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送包含\"%3F+.htr\"后缀的恶意请求，该请求会被服务器的.HTR ISAPI扩展错误处理，导致可执行Web程序的源代码被当作普通文本文件返回并暴露给攻击者。此漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本IIS的Windows服务器，攻击者通过利用该漏洞可以获取Web应用程序的敏感源代码信息，进而可能发现更多安全缺陷或获取数据库连接凭据等机密数据，造成信息泄露风险。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0004"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"首选措施为在 IIS 中彻底禁用 .HTR 脚本映射：打开 Internet Services Manager，右键点击目标 Web 服务器，依次选择「属性」→「主属性」→「WWW 服务」，点击「编辑」→「主目录」→「配置」，在「应用程序扩展」列表中找到 .HTR 条目并移除，确认后重启 IIS 服务使配置生效。对于 IIS 4.0（Windows NT 4.0 SP5/SP6a）和 IIS 5.0（Windows 2000 Gold/SP1/SP2），若业务确实需要保留 .HTR 功能，则需安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-004 补丁 KB285985（IIS 4.0 下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=A8270ADC-A836-4B32-A7AF-9E7BE14845A5；IIS 5.0 下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=04FAB0BC-D950-4E64-8672-2731756B72FE）。补丁安装后可通过注册表验证：IIS 4.0 检查键值 HKLM\\software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Hotfix\\Q285985 是否存在；IIS 5.0 检查 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Updates\\Windows 2000\\SP3\\Q285985。该补丁同时覆盖了 MS00-031 和 MS00-044 公告中描述的 HTR 相关漏洞。此外，建议在 IIS 中一并移除 .IDQ、.IDA、.HTW 等不必要的脚本映射，以降低攻击面，具体可参考 Microsoft IIS 4.0 安全检查清单（https://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/chklist/iischk.mspx）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97897954625305&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2313","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-004","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5903","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0004.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0004.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0004.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0004","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0004.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0004.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0004.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/feb3588b82c9620d09c69f65c4fe01c2dcf3dd03/2001/CVE-2001-0004.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0004.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0004.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0571.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0570","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0570.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0003","title":"Microsoft Windows Web Client NTLM 认证信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2000、Windows 2000 及 Windows Me 中的 Web Extender Client（WEC）组件在处理 Internet Explorer 安全设置与 NTLM 身份验证交互时存在安全缺陷，未能正确继承和强制执行 IE 的安全区域配置。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过特制网页或网络链接诱使受害系统使用 WEC 发起 NTLM 身份验证请求，进而拦截并获取用户的 NTLM 凭据，理论上可进一步离线破解获得明文密码。该漏洞影响所有使用上述受影响系统版本且启用 WEC 功能的用户，攻击条件简单，无需用户预先授权或交互即可在网络中被利用，主要威胁为凭据泄露及由此引发的横向移动风险。微软已于 2001 年 2 月发布安全公告 MS01-009 及对应补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0003"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS01-001。Office 2000 用户需先安装 SR-1a 再打补丁；Windows 2000 Gold/SP1 用户安装对应补丁，后续升级至 Service Pack 2 可包含此修复；Windows Me Gold 用户安装对应补丁。临时缓解措施：在 Internet Explorer 中禁用自动登录到 Intranet 区域以外的站点，并避免浏览不受信任的网站或打开不明来源的 HTML 邮件。由于 Windows 2000、Windows Me 及 Office 2000 均已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的操作系统与 Office 版本以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2199","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-001","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5920","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0003","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f6551b9664b7c57bdc824f681a941c2766269db/2001/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0003.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0003.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0003.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0570.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0390","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0390.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1273","title":"Linux Linux Kernel mxcsr P4 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.17-14 之前版本在特定 Intel CPU 上存在 \"mxcsr P4\" 漏洞，本地用户可通过操作 MXCSR 控制寄存器触发内核异常，导致系统停机拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行在特定 Intel Pentium 4 处理器上的 Linux 内核 2.2.17-14 之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且无需特权，通过执行特制指令序列操作 MXCSR 寄存器触发内核异常导致系统停机，CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属低危本地拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1273"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.17-14 或更高版本（如 2.4.x 稳定分支），该版本修复了 Pentium 4 上 mxcsr 寄存器导致的本地拒绝服务漏洞。若无法立即升级内核，可限制本地用户登录权限或通过 GRUB 启动参数添加 `nopentium4` 禁用 Pentium 4 特定优化作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/l-045.shtml","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-013.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1273.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1273","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1273.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1273.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-35mm-49c2-78fg/GHSA-35mm-49c2-78fg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86996/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1273.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Dataset/Dataset/CVE_list.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0390.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0225","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0101","title":"fetchmail fetchmail GSSAPI认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"fetchmail 5.5.0-2 及更早版本在 AUTHENTICATE GSSAPI 命令处理中存在安全漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，通过向运行 fetchmail 的邮件服务器发送特制的 GSSAPI 认证请求，触发内存处理异常，导致攻击者能够完全控制目标系统，实现机密信息窃取、数据篡改及服务中断。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 fetchmail 的邮件代理服务，攻击复杂度低，危害等级严重。Red Hat 和 TurboLinux 已发布相关安全公告和补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0101"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"升级 fetchmail 至 5.5.0-3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 fetchmail 配置文件中禁用 GSSAPI 认证（设置 `auth ssh` 或 `auth kerberos_v5` 避免使用 GSSAPI 路径），或在网络边界限制对 fetchmail 服务的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHBA-2000-106.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-December/000027.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7455","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0101","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2001/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0101.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0101.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0225.toml"}]